*   **convenience\_feature\_score (+0.80):** Equipped with numerous convenience features such as Comfort Access, power tailgate, and Parking Assistant Professional (Source [3], [6], [8], [22], [23], [25], [30]). Remote Control Parking is available with specific packs (Source [4]).
